{
  "description": "Hand-computed rows of docs/format/playlist-v1.md#how-the-board-chooses-what-to-play. schedules holds valid pixelart-schedule/1 documents by key. Each row gives the settings play (auto, playlists or schedule), playlists and schedule; stored, the valid schedules stored on the board, by ID, each naming a key of schedules (an ID that is not there is not stored, and a schedule that is stored but not valid is not listed); server_choice (null, {\"schedule\": id} or {\"playlists\": [ids]}); the local date (YYYY-MM-DD, or null when the time is not known); and playable, the IDs of the stored playlists the board can play. expected is what status.play reports besides mode and server_choice: source (server, playlists, schedule or fallback), schedule (the ID of the schedule the list comes from, or null), reason, entry (the winning entry's 0-based index, or null), playlists (the list the board plays) and playing (the first playable playlist of that list, or null when the board plays every animation).",
